{"unit_id":"Pasumao__dsh-plugin-context-trim#feature-1","repo":"Pasumao/dsh-plugin-context-trim","commit":"9cd741845f2214104fb77c02e72c0b599c5c604d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-context-trim 的功能「按会话隐藏技能」：为当前 agent 注册同名影子技能，使其不再对模型可调用，同时保留用户调用状态。保存选择后会在有活 agent 时立即重应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/applier.js:143-184","lib/index.js:260-270"]}
